dtk-update (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * feat: implement distro upstream security advisories + recent notices fetching.
    SecurityAdvisor now pulls per-family feeds (Debian DSA RDF, Ubuntu USN RSS,
    openSUSE security-announce, Arch news) for upstream advisories matched to
    upgradable packages, plus optional per-distro "recent news/notices" feeds.
  * fix: make all SecurityAdvisor network access asynchronous (QNetworkAccessManager
    + QTimer::singleShot timeout), removing QEventLoop::exec() blocking of the host
    thread; prefetchUpstream caches and applyUpdates merges synchronously with no
    network call.
  * fix: drop redundant m_available snapshot in favor of live
    QDBusConnection::systemBus().interface()->isServiceRegistered() probing.
  * docs: expand README (en/zh-CN) with per-distro upstream feed and recent
    notices behavior; update AGENTS.md security/advisor description and add the
    "verify upstream feed URLs for staleness" long-task checklist item.

 -- dtk-update taotieren <admin@taotieren.com>  Thu, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

dtk-update (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * cleanup: remove stray empty src/core/cleanup directory (no source, not in
    CMakeLists); residual/cache cleanup lives in healthcheck + PackageBackend
    CleanCache/Autoremove operations.
  * fix: drop redundant const_cast in LinyapsBackend::runQuery stream parsing.
  * refactor: remove redundant SecurityAdvisor::m_available snapshot, probe deepin
    SecurityCenter availability at call time via isServiceRegistered.
  * docs: align AGENTS.md with implementation; add post-task verification
    checklist to prevent missing / unimplemented / dead code.

 -- dtk-update taotieren <admin@taotieren.com>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

dtk-update (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * refactor: centralize Linyaps backend wiring in BackendFactory::attachLinyaps,
    eliminating duplicated probe/connect boilerplate in GUI and both trays.
  * refactor: route DependencyResolver dry-run parsing by real backendId (APT/DNF
    formats) and degrade gracefully to target-only packages for backends without
    structured transaction output (fixes false failures on dnf/linyaps).
  * docs: align README (en/zh-CN) packaging script reference, design constraints and
    backend-extension guide with the actual implementation; clarify attachLinyaps wiring.
  * debian: add dtk-update.install, expand control Description, refresh changelog.
  * ci: fix arm64 runner label typo (ubuntu-24.04-arm64 -> ubuntu-24.04-arm) and add a
    120-minute timeout guard for the loong64 qemu build job.
  * refactor: decouple multi-backend wiring, modularize upgrade flow,
    synchronize docs, translations, CI and debian packaging.
  * Initial release: tray plugin skeleton, package backend abstraction,
    dependency resolver, health checks, security advisor, monitor,
    systemd user service and debian packaging.

 -- dtk-update taotieren <admin@taotieren.com>  Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
